                "Copy the secret|Open the client's **Credentials** tab and copy the **Client secret**.",
                "Add the provider in the Wiki|Settings → Single sign-on → **Add identity provider → Keycloak**. Enter the Keycloak **Domain** (host name, with port if any) and **Realm**; the issuer `https://<domain>/realms/<realm>` is filled in. Enter the client ID and secret, choose the directory and **Save and continue**.",
