            H("Other OpenID Connect providers"),
            P("Any provider that publishes `/.well-known/openid-configuration` works (for example Ping Identity, OneLogin, JumpCloud, Authentik, Zitadel, Dex, GitLab). Register a **confidential web application** with the **authorization code** flow, register the Wiki's **Redirect URI**, and enter the **Issuer URL**, **Client ID** and **Client secret**. The Wiki uses PKCE and checks the ID token's signature, issuer, audience, expiry and nonce; the provider must sign ID tokens with a key from its published key set."),

            H("Microsoft Entra ID (SAML)"),
            P("Use SAML if your organization standardizes on it; otherwise the OpenID Connect setup above is simpler."),
